/**
 * The 2026 regular season as the league's own sheet records it, transcribed from
 * section 6.5 of `docs/knowledge-base.md`. Test fixture only: the versioned seed
 * the site falls back on is generated by the importer in a later phase.
 *
 * It holds rounds 1 to 5 plus the 6th-versus-7th play-in, which is what the
 * published 4 July 2026 standings cover. The playoff rounds are left out because
 * their participants were still undetermined when the sheet was handed over.
 *
 * Two rows are kept deliberately awkward, because the source is:
 *
 * - round 1 carries a match with a time and a venue and no teams;
 * - round 5 leaves the "Resultado" and "Ganador" columns empty on its last four
 *   matches. The goals are the reliable part, and every one of those matches was
 *   decided by more than a goal, so they are transcribed as regulation results.
 *   The published PGR column agrees: it accounts for exactly two shootout wins
 *   all season, both in earlier rounds.
 */

